meta {
  name: LLM wire index
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/llm-wire/index
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  The bodiless exchange ledger: one object per exchange in file order, request and response paired by xid while streaming the file — bodies are counted, never returned. A request still waiting for its response reports status null. 404 for a foreign caller, a malformed id or a session without a wire record.
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: no
}
